It means the space of possible physics is much larger than the physics we actually observe.

50:10.840 --> 50:12.060
Okay, I need to take a breath.

50:12.560 --> 50:14.480
Let's bring this all back home for the listener.

50:14.980 --> 50:16.660
We have been on quite a journey today.

